# Play test of the plan 'The Abyss Expedition' (CIPlay plan_abyss, in a test world 'CI ...'): main story beside Raft's
# story - each island's coordinates come when the one before is done (its quest, or players reaching it), it is tuned
# to on the Receiver and played to its end with its own test.
plan The Abyss Expedition
tune mine
include old_mine_islet.play
tune shelter
include shelter_atoll.play
tune sunken
# (its top is under water: the player swims over it - a visit counts within its land's radius)
at 0 0
tune caverns
include ironreef_caverns.play
tune wreck
stand
tune city
include drowned_metropolis.play
tune abyss
include the_abyss.play
expect blueprints
plan end
